    "detailed_description": "<strong>Kindly be informed that the Goliath game remains under active development. We are committed to incorporating forthcoming enhancements, bug fixes, listening to community feedback, all of which will encompass a variety of game modes, additional maps, and diverse character options coming in the form of DLC packs coming soon.<br><i><br>He was an inevitable wave that washed away all our world\u2019s governing<br>systems, alliances, and protectors. Our world was no match for a<br>ruler from the stars with his superior strength and exhaustive<br>knowledge of our world.<br><br>And so our world became his.<br>Every year since our planet has come under his \u201cprotection\u201d,<br>Goliath hosts a tournament of the best warriors from what few<br>regions we have left. His hidden agenda is to use these games to seek<br>out and dispose of any potential threats.<br><br>Our goal, as warriors, is to win the tournament for the right to<br>challenge Goliath and take back our freedom!</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476030/extras/3d4d78a558d325b66b668c968a543371.avif?t=1703464016\" /></span></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Kindly be informed that the Goliath game remains under active development. We are committed to incorporating forthcoming enhancements, bug fixes, listening to community feedback, all of which will encompass a variety of game modes, additional maps, and diverse character options coming in the form of DLC packs coming soon.<br><i><br>He was an inevitable wave that washed away all our world\u2019s governing<br>systems, alliances, and protectors. Our world was no match for a<br>ruler from the stars with his superior strength and exhaustive<br>knowledge of our world.<br><br>And so our world became his.<br>Every year since our planet has come under his \u201cprotection\u201d,<br>Goliath hosts a tournament of the best warriors from what few<br>regions we have left. His hidden agenda is to use these games to seek<br>out and dispose of any potential threats.<br><br>Our goal, as warriors, is to win the tournament for the right to<br>challenge Goliath and take back our freedom!</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476030/extras/3d4d78a558d325b66b668c968a543371.avif?t=1703464016\" /></span></strong>",
